      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just really uncomfortable. and honestly i dont really have any neosporin right now. i do have some lidocaine cream in my medicine cabinet though. how much of that should i just slather on there to make the pain stop? can i just use a lot of it so it works faster since it's already blistering?",
